<description>&lt;p&gt;Iraqi courts have sentenced six French nationals to life imprisonment and a seventh to 15 years for Islamic State membership, while a separate court sentenced seven French citizens to lengthy terms for the same crime. Security forces have repeatedly intercepted unidentified drones near Baghdad's Green Zone, with multiple reports confirming the incidents. PKK-linked Yazidi militia units are disarming and joining the Iraqi army, and three militia groups have pledged to disarm by June 2027. Iran’s rhetoric has intensified, warning the United States over its stance, and the United States has warned Baghdad it will strike Iraqi militias that join Iran’s war. The conflict produced 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxNd3diR0NyX0hNdXhLdktmb3J1bXZwYjBHd3k3XzlRQ1dBU29nd1BxYlh2aWREUGVBNjdiN011Q3RvM0UtRjVjVDAzbDVLZFNWSmprcVAzc3FKaWxXY05laEhQQllPTUNpYk1OQXRkWS1mb2xOOUY0Q3NSZUxFazdlSV9EOFNyclNWSUl1UTVSUjMzZFlvTzJWdnFOa1ItTkhZNjd6V3hfOENISXFuZWhRT3JlVlEzQkNjbnlreWRXZUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxNUzJDUXRkNklTTk5rVi1JVVhCSWZDb1U3aGUzNDBBeWRZVXhNbHkta0tmcmNFNnpnZ2hJWGVEaWhTNDc3QTMxeFBhTFR3Q3hLZkwzb09lcXNVRzFQd093dmxqc0xzT2x5T05ZVkUtNTFTd0VSd1RGLXd4THlDN2hjUVk1UEZBV1BDUHRYR0lsUmtZUDNpbVFfc2FqMjZ5aTQxRWVNeUNuUkJUM2plT3RwbFV5WG9hTzFGcTBr?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiywFBVV95cUxOMUpsUVVRSU1VUjRLbm5YVzVQNnJuMDJHemVRN1pRanBYSFhMOFFsWEhrWDVLVEV1YU5aSWoySjBFMHR3SzZ1bjNMMUpjY1NIbGJoUmhCUHp0NU9CMzMtaHl5NVZwNmJVRmZ1U2NCZ0N3b2dGeU1QeEJjMEdudzF4MmNuRDNnQThoQkgzTE9kWThfNVdmQnRyOVZEWmZUb3ZsMDB5NTY3TDNMN1hMWFYtcGhFRmJydHAxSEcxVEgwVmV3TEJVMTZNc1EzUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Internazionale&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news